From 3616599f035de70f0898af006437986498ebd59d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 23:02:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] network: pin an add-on's VFS requests to its uplink

A Python add-on that fetches with xbmcvfs instead of its own sockets
reached the network over the default route, whatever uplink
advancedsettings.xml gives it, and CCurlFile took the uplink options
of an FTP URL only for HTTP. Stamp the add-on's uplink on the network
URLs passed to xbmcvfs.File, xbmcvfs.Stat and the module's path
functions, through the same helper that pins a plugin's resolved URL,
and read the uplink of FTP URLs as well.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
---
